            <div xml:id="d1142">

                <pb facs="0819" n="703" xml:id="pg703"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 812.6363/66.</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">Consul Miller to the
                            Secretary of State.</hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg>
                </opener>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">American Consulate</hi>, <lb/>
                            <hi rendition="#italic">Tampico</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1914-05-15T10:00:00-06:41">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">May 15, 1914, 10 a.m.</hi>
                        </date>
                    </dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>Department’s May 14, 12 noon. Constitutional authorities assure me that all
                    foreigners can safely return to their work and to their homes. Number oil men
                    already on grounds preparing resume operations.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Miller</hi></signed>.</closer>
            </div>
